  "release_notes": "# KurokoCast 0.1.0-beta.15\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Restores Google microphone recognition after long idle periods with a safe watchdog restart.\n- Includes beta.15 validation fixes for OCR UI capture, OCR runtime imports, reading order, and OCR translation handling.\n- Includes local ASR/OCR diagnostic and support ZIP performance improvements.\n\n## Notes\n\n- This beta does not bundle AI-DLC runtime assets in the installer.\n- The AI-DLC metadata block is unchanged from the previous beta metadata.\n- Diagnostics and support output avoid transcript text, OCR text, translation text, tokens, API keys, URLs, and full local paths.",
